WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:08.980
An engineer saves fifty pence on a part you make two hundred thousand times a year. That's a hundred thousand pounds of extra profit.

2
00:00:09.330 --> 00:00:17.100
To make the same profit from new sales, at an eight per cent margin, you'd have to sell one and a quarter million pounds more.

3
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:22.630
And most of a product's cost is decided before production even starts.

4
00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:29.410
VAVE for Leaders: one hour on what it pays back, and the five things only leaders can do.

5
00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:34.030
Your next point of margin is hiding in your products.
